OL,3,AFrance accuses Iran of supermarket
OL,4,Afridge hacking
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrance has accused Iran of being behind
OL,7,Fcyber-attacks that raised the
OL,8,Ftemperatures of supermarket fridges and
OL,9,Ffreezers.
OL,11,FFrench Foreign Minister Jean-Noel
OL,12,FBarrot said the attack was carried out
OL,13,Fby the Islamic Revolutionary Guard
OL,14,FCorps (IRGC) of Iran.
OL,16,FHe said the attack was "unprecedented
OL,17,Fin both its scale and its level of
OL,18,Faggression", adding that the country
OL,19,Fwould "implement sanctions at the
OL,20,FEuropean level against all those
OL,21,Fresponsible for this attack".
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
